This product uses open data. Data are not covered by the Apache License;
each dataset keeps its own terms, listed in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md and in
frontend/public/data/provenance.v1.json.

NASA data (public domain / NASA open data policy):
  - Mars 2020 TRN CTX DTM and orthomosaic, USGS Astrogeology (Fergason et al. 2020)
  - LRO LOLA south-pole DEM and Sun-visibility products, NASA GSFC Planetary Geodesy Data Archive
  - NASA GIBS imagery (Blue Marble) and NASA Planetary Analog Explorer site list
  - Globe textures: NASA Blue Marble Next Generation, USGS/NASA Ames Viking MDIM 2.1,
    NASA LRO LROC WAC mosaic (NASA Moon Trek)

Other agency / third-party data (optional extras, attribution required):
  - Copernicus DEM GLO-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH
    2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA
  - AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen/Terrarium), various open sources
  - Sentinel-2 cloudless by EOX IT Services GmbH (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) — scheduled for
    removal in v2 because its non-commercial terms do not meet the Space Apps rules

Original prototype repository: https://github.com/hellorifat/solmate (team member
Rifatul). This repository, https://github.com/Tanbin-CS/solmate, is the team's
submission repository.
